"entity": {
"name": "Cie Generale des Etablissements Michelin SA",
"description": "Compagnie G\u00e9n\u00e9rale des \u00c9tablissements Michelin SCA engages in the manufacture, distribution and sale of tires. The company operates through the following segments: Automotive and related distribution, Road transportation and related distribution, and Specialty businesses. Its products and services include tires, mobility services, lifestyle products, Michelin solutions and Michelin engineering and services. The company was founded by Aristide Barbier and \u00c9douard Daubr\u00e9e on July 15, 1863 and is headquartered in Clermont-Ferrand, France.",
